    SiteA->>SiteB: IKE init
    SiteB-->>SiteA: IKE reply
    SiteA->>SiteB: IKE auth
    SiteB-->>SiteA: Auth ok
    SiteA->>SiteB: IPsec setup
    SiteB-->>SiteA: Tunnel up
    SiteA->>SiteB: Traffic
